            <div xml:id="d788">

                <pb facs="0774" n="608" xml:id="pg608"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.5914/51a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister Egan </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-21T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 21, 1916, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>89. Your 227 March 20, 4 p.m. Department’s 88. After “parsonages appertaining
                    thereto” read “Article III. It is specifically agreed however that.”</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
